## Still blocking the secrets

Open `src/common/config/secret-manager.ts` in the backend repo on GitHub and paste it. Remove any values first. Then run:
```bash
gcloud secrets locations list --project=pg-ae-n-app-125609 | grep -i me-central2
```
Everything I've said about the secrets so far assumes you can recreate them in `me-central2`, and this output decides that.
